{"4530520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hostile Entity", "steam_appid": 4530520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4806630], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality has been breached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent of <strong>The Reality Compliance Office (T.R.C.O.)</strong>, a covert government division responsible for containing supernatural threats and unexplained anomalies. When a catastrophic rift in reality begins swallowing people, locations, and entire task forces, T.R.C.O launches a classified operation known as <strong>Project NOCLIP</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple agents have entered the breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None have returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the next agent sent into the anomaly — a distorted dimension filled with twisted environments, hostile creatures, and impossible structures that defy the laws of reality. Somewhere inside this labyrinth, an entity known only as <strong>Smiles</strong> controls the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the anomaly has a darker origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rift was created by the tortured soul of a boy who died during a classified experiment conducted by T.R.C.O. The weight of his suffering fractured reality itself, creating a gateway where nightmares bleed into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the entity behind the breach has built a maze of hostile dimensions to trap anyone who enters — and to make the world suffer as he did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the breach.<br>Eliminate the threat.<br>Close the rift before reality collapses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 30+ Levels</strong><br>Fight your way through a series of dangerous environments within a warped dimension where every level presents new threats and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Boss Encounters</strong><br>Face powerful hostile entities guarding the depths of the anomaly, each with unique attacks and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Top-Down Combat</strong><br>Dodge, fight, and survive against relentless enemies in a brutal action-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>Discover what really happened inside the T.R.C.O experiments and the events that created the breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Maze</strong><br>Survive the anomaly and stop the entity controlling it before the damage spreads into the real world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality has been breached.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent of <strong>The Reality Compliance Office (T.R.C.O.)</strong>, a covert government division responsible for containing supernatural threats and unexplained anomalies. When a catastrophic rift in reality begins swallowing people, locations, and entire task forces, T.R.C.O launches a classified operation known as <strong>Project NOCLIP</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple agents have entered the breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >None have returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the next agent sent into the anomaly — a distorted dimension filled with twisted environments, hostile creatures, and impossible structures that defy the laws of reality. Somewhere inside this labyrinth, an entity known only as <strong>Smiles</strong> controls the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the anomaly has a darker origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rift was created by the tortured soul of a boy who died during a classified experiment conducted by T.R.C.O. The weight of his suffering fractured reality itself, creating a gateway where nightmares bleed into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now the entity behind the breach has built a maze of hostile dimensions to trap anyone who enters — and to make the world suffer as he did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is clear:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the breach.<br>Eliminate the threat.<br>Close the rift before reality collapses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 30+ Levels</strong><br>Fight your way through a series of dangerous environments within a warped dimension where every level presents new threats and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Boss Encounters</strong><br>Face powerful hostile entities guarding the depths of the anomaly, each with unique attacks and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Top-Down Combat</strong><br>Dodge, fight, and survive against relentless enemies in a brutal action-driven experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>Discover what really happened inside the T.R.C.O experiments and the events that created the breach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Maze</strong><br>Survive the anomaly and stop the entity controlling it before the damage spreads into the real world.</p>", "short_description": "A reality breach has unleashed something terrible. Fight through 30+ levels, deadly enemies, and brutal boss fights in this 2D top-down horror action game to stop the entity behind the anomaly.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530520/e521cf40d9be025cacf0614543d2058f95515c71/header.jpg?t=1788125316", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4530520/7efeb0876f50cffb083e8cfffbb32fdf3a089e43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788125316", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea